                <div class="rendering rendering_researchoutput  rendering_researchoutput_harvard rendering_contributiontojournal rendering_harvard rendering_contributiontojournal_harvard">Barratt, MJ, Coomber, R, Kowalski, M<a rel="Person" href="https://research.manchester.ac.uk/en/persons/judith.aldridge/" class="link"><span>, Aldridge, J</span></a>, Munksgaard, R, Ferris, JA, James, M &amp; Décary-Hétu, D 2024, '<a rel="ContributionToJournal" href="https://research.manchester.ac.uk/en/publications/how-accurate-are-drug-cryptomarket-listings-by-content-weight-pur/" class="link harvard_title"><span>How accurate are drug cryptomarket listings by content, weight, purity and repeat purchase?</span></a>', <span><em>Drugs, Habits and Social Policy</em></span>. <a onclick="window.open(this.href, '_blank','noopener,noreferrer'); return false;" href="https://doi.org/10.1108/DHS-11-2023-0043," class="link"><span>https://doi.org/10.1108/DHS-11-2023-0043,</span></a></div>
